# Soft wrap on a long line, then the command palette turns it off.
file long.txt
short line
The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog, and then it keeps running across the field, past the barn, over the hill, and far beyond the river until the sun goes down.
another short line
end
run long.txt
wait short line
snap wrapped
key ctrl+p
type wrap
snap palette
key enter
snap unwrapped
key down alt+right
snap scrolled
